	(descr "Direct coax solder termination for RG-316 / RG-58 pigtails. Pad 1: center conductor (1.4 mm hole). Pad 2: braid - 1.8 mm through hole plus a 7 x 4 mm exposed copper area on both sides to solder the braid flat (tie into the ground pour with several vias). Two 3.2 mm holes for a cable tie strain relief. Cable enters from -Y; keep exposed center conductor <= 5 mm.")
